{
 "_doc": "Ezra Vane's camp (ADR-0058): a small wilderness set piece by a power line, away from roads and towns, where the companion waits to be found. A lineman's line truck (the pickup) pulled off the line road and barricaded with a power pole he dropped across its open side, a tarp strung off the truck over his bedroll, a fire ring, and a plywood gear shed for his kit (the loot room). Ezra sits by the fire with a splinted leg (not a sleeper: CompanionDirector seats him at data/companions/ezra.json camp.offset). No Hollowed: the barricade and the fire kept them off. Route: up from the line -> the fire, Ezra -> the gear shed. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
